('Var Shadowing','When a subclass field shadows a parent field, the correct field is resolved by:','MCQ','HARD','OOP','Inheritance','["Runtime type of the object","Compile-time type of the reference variable","The most recent declaration","Random resolution"]','Compile-time type of the reference variable'),
('Polymorphic Field','Given Animal a = new Dog();, a.name accesses:','MCQ','HARD','OOP','Inheritance','["Dog.name always","Animal.name (field access is NOT polymorphic)","Causes ClassCastException","Causes NullPointerException"]','Animal.name (field access is NOT polymorphic)'),
('Constructor Visibility','A constructor can be package-private (no modifier). What does this mean?','MCQ','HARD','OOP','Inheritance','["No subclass can instantiate the class","Only classes in the same package can instantiate it","The class is effectively final","The class has no constructor"]','Only classes in the same package can instantiate it'),
