('Inherit Private Via','A subclass can access a parent''s private field:','MCQ','HARD','OOP','Inheritance','["Directly","Via public/protected getter methods in the parent","Using reflection only at runtime","Via super keyword"]','Via public/protected getter methods in the parent'),
