('Accessible Field','Write the Java reflection code to make a private field named secret in class Config accessible and set it to 42 on object cfg.','CODING','HARD','OOP','Encapsulation',NULL,'Field f = Config.class.getDeclaredField("secret"); f.setAccessible(true); f.set(cfg, 42);'),
('Unmodifiable Map','Write a getter for a private Map<String,Integer> scores that returns an unmodifiable view.','CODING','HARD','OOP','Encapsulation',NULL,'public Map<String,Integer> getScores() { return Collections.unmodifiableMap(scores); }'),
